(45, 'privacy_policy', '<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Privacy Policy for Abaad App</title>\n    <style>\n        body {\n            font-family: \'Arial\', sans-serif;\n            line-height: 1.6;\n            margin: 20px;\n        }\n\n        h1, h2 {\n            color: #333;\n        }\n\n        strong {\n            color: #555;\n        }\n\n        p {\n            margin-bottom: 15px;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <h1>Privacy Policy for Abaad App</h1>\n\n\n    <h2>1. Introduction:</h2>\n    <p>The \"Abaad \" app is committed to protecting the privacy and security of user information. This privacy policy aims to explain how we collect, use, and safeguard the personal information obtained from users while using the \"Abaad\" app.</p>\n\n    <h2>2. Information We Collect:</h2>\n    <p>We collect information provided by users with their explicit consent, including personal information such as name and email address. We may also collect non-personal information such as usage data and interaction with the application.</p>\n\n    <!-- Additional points go here -->\n\n    <h2>3. Use of Information:</h2>\n    <p>We use the information obtained to improve the user experience, customize services, analyze application usage, and ensure the security and effective performance of the service.</p>\n\n    <!-- Additional points go here -->\n\n    <h2>4. Information Sharing:</h2>\n    <p>We do not share personal information with third parties without explicit consent from users, except in specific cases related to service provision (such as service providers contributing to the operation of the application).</p>\n\n    <!-- Additional points go here -->\n\n    <h2>5. Information Security:</h2>\n    <p>We take appropriate security measures to protect our users\' personal information from unauthorized access, use, alteration, or disclosure.</p>\n\n    <!-- Additional points go here -->\n\n    <h2>6. User Rights:</h2>\n    <p>Users have the right to review and correct their personal information, and they also have the right to request the complete deletion of their information.</p>\n\n    <!-- Additional points go here -->\n\n    <h2>7. Changes to Privacy Policy:</h2>\n    <p>We may update this privacy policy from time to time, and users will be notified of any significant changes through appropriate communication channels.</p>\n\n    <!-- Additional points go here -->\n\n    <h2>8. Contact:</h2>\n    <p>If you have any questions or inquiries regarding the privacy policy, please contact us via email at <a href=\"info@pdm.sa\"> info@pdm.sa </a> or through the available channels in the application.</p>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n', NULL, '2021-07-06 11:09:07'),
